  "title": "Nourishing Crispy Japanese Cheese Tagine",
  "description": "A garlicky and crisp Japanese dish featuring cheddar cheese, cooked in a tagine style, perfect as a hangover cure, and vegetarian friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Japanese",
